STREAMS — el map/filter/reduce de Java:
  List<Integer> nums = List.of(1, 2, 3, 4, 5);
  int sumaPares = nums.stream()
      .filter(n -> n % 2 == 0)
      .mapToInt(n -> n * 10)
      .sum();
  System.out.println(sumaPares);      // 60

